          "Clenching or grinding (bruxism): overloads the implant and crown.",
          "Osteoporosis medicines or certain cancer medicines, especially injected ones: tell the dentist before any surgery.",
          "Previous radiotherapy to the head and neck.",
          "Poor daily oral hygiene.",
